    theme: NotRequired[Literal["light", "dark", "auto"]]
    #: Whether the stored SVG carries the diagram source in its metadata, so the picture can be edited later: read_diagram gives the source back from the link. The source is part of the picture, which anyone who has the link can read (for a diagram in an organisation, every member who can open it). Left out, a personal diagram carries the source, and a diagram that lands in an organisation follows its keepEditable setting (on unless the owner turned it off). Send false to leave the source out, such as for a public link whose labels name internal systems. The same diagram published with and without it is two pictures with two links.
    embedSource: NotRequired[bool]
    #: A label for the diagram in your list and in the Markdown snippet. Optional.
    name: NotRequired[str]
